      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 235,
      "height": 88,
      "text": "• Ordered, reliable streams\n• Retransmit lost packets\n• Congestion control\n• Used by HTTP, most DBs\n• Higher overhead",
